  "details": "Version: Build 928\nDescription of the bug:\nWhen running VRChat through SteamVR, some worlds/situations seem to crash SteamVR. SteamVR reports that it experienced an unexpected error, and the computer must be rebooted before SteamVR can run again. Not sure if this is a SteamVR bug or a VRChat bug, but so far i've only encountered it with VRChat and SteamVR (the Oculus VRC client is unaffected).\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): Unknown.\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots): \nSee output log: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1VLWpUNabB7WmaESRadHWu1LR56hn6mrn/view?usp=sharing\nAnother output log of it happening again: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1L3CMJI7D9BgePJZBGasFzxY459BonmK4/view?usp=sharing\nAnother output log from another user (LittlePoe) when it happened to him: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/532903739514814484/711639921135452210/output_log_18-37-44.txt",
